  "content": "<pre><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">真·三國無雙系列中的關羽梗<br><br>這個模組不提供新武器或物品，僅為史詩戰鬥增加一種新的武器類型。</span><br></span><br></span></pre><pre><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">因此你需要搭配我已做好相容的 <span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spartan Weaponry（戰戟）</a></span>、<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights（洛哈伯戰斧）</a></span> 或 <span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeons-gear\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dungeons Gear（戰戟）</a></span> 一起遊玩</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">，<br>或者</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fepicfight-docs.readthedocs.io%252fen%252flatest%252fGuides%252fpage2%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><span><strong>自製資料包</strong></span></span></span></a></span><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> 自行將某武器類型定義為彎刀。</span></span></span></span></pre><pre><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f90\">強烈建議搭配 <span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a style=\"color:#f90\" href=\"https://beta.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/epic-fight-animations/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight Animations 資源包</a></span> 一起遊玩。</span></pre><pre><span><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;font-size:14px\"><br>資料包範例：</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;font-size:14px\">{{ \"attributes\": { \"common\": { \"armor_negation\":7.0, \"impact\":1.5, \"max_strikes\":2 } }, \"type\":\"falchion\"}<br><br></span></span></pre><pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此動作集包含三次普通攻擊和三種特殊技能。<br>三種不同的特殊技能取決於你按下的<strong>方向鍵</strong>。<br><strong>無畏（被動）：</strong>第三次普通攻擊不會被敵人的攻擊打斷。<br><strong>前 + 特殊技能：</strong>對前方快速進行兩次上撩斬，可有效擊退敵人。<br><strong>左/右 + 特殊技能：</strong>快速斜斬，不會被敵人的攻擊打斷。<br><strong>後 + 特殊技能：</strong>大範圍橫掃後，對敵人進行擊倒斬擊。可對倒地的敵人使用空中斬擊追加攻擊。</span></pre><pre><span>&nbsp;<br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/h2cNB7Z/falchion-normal-attack.gif\" alt=\"彎刀-普通攻擊\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PNvgmdV/Falchion-Forward-Attack.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"><br></span></pre><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/g9y38DL/Falchion-Backward-Attack.gif\" alt=\"彎刀-後方攻擊\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/L92vCBv/Falchion-Side-Attack.gif\" alt=\"彎刀-側面攻擊\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
